// Negative fixture: checklist semantic error 2 - type mismatch.
// A string cannot be assigned to an int, and there is no cast syntax to
// force it. (The reverse narrowing, float -> int, is rejected too; the
// only implicit conversions in the language are char -> int -> float.)
void main() {
    var int count;

    count = "twenty";
    print(count);
}
